  "coverLetter": {"body": "<p>Dear Taylor,</p><p>I am writing to apply for the Senior Frontend Engineer role at Tailspin Toys. For eight years I have built React applications that stay fast as they grow — most recently a checkout rebuild at Northwind Traders that cut drop-off by 18%.</p><p>Your team's work on playful, accessible shopping experiences is exactly where I do my best work. I would bring a habit of measuring before optimising, a design system built with designers rather than for them, and tests that make releases boring.</p><p>I would welcome the chance to talk about how I could help your team ship its next launch.</p>", "closing": "Sincerely", "company": "Tailspin Toys", "date": "", "recipientName": "Taylor Brooks", "recipientTitle": "Engineering Manager", "subject": "Senior Frontend Engineer"}
 },
